  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction: Welcome to Cosplay Bazaar, a vibrant community dedicated to the art of anime cosplay. We celebrate anime culture by offering high-quality, handmade costumes, accessories, and custom designs for fans who love to immerse themselves in the world of their favorite anime characters. Whether you're attending conventions or expressing your passion online, we provide cosplay enthusiasts with the best gear to bring their favorite characters to life.&nbsp;<br>&bull; Product description:&nbsp;Explore a wide range of cosplay costumes and accessories inspired by popular anime series. From meticulously crafted outfits to detailed props, our products are designed with precision and care to ensure you look and feel like the character you adore. Our costumes cater to all sizes and preferences, from beginner cosplayers to seasoned veterans.&nbsp;<br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): Unique, customizable, and high-quality cosplay products that stand out. We focus on delivering exceptional craftsmanship, attention to detail, and comfort for cosplayers, all at competitive prices. Our items are made with premium materials to ensure durability and authenticity.&nbsp;<br>&bull; Payment terms: Affiliate commissions are paid on a [monthly] basis, with payouts processed through PayPal. Please note that commissions are earned based on completed sales, and the minimum payout threshold is 20$. &nbsp;<br>&bull; Other information: We offer free shipping on all orders over 50$ and exclusive discounts for repeat customers. As part of our affiliate program, you&rsquo;ll have access to regular promotions and creative assets to help boost your earnings.&nbsp;</p>\r\n</div>",
